      "caption": "Every symbol has a binding in .symtab: GLOBAL (strong), WEAK, or COMMON.",
      "narration": "The symbol table tags each global with a binding. Functions and initialized variables are strong. Weak must be requested, and uninitialized C globals may be COMMON.",
